      "summary": "Free API key in 30 seconds. No approval, no credit card.",
      "how_to_get_a_key": {
        "step_1": "把下面这条命令里的邮箱换成你自己的，直接执行：",
        "command": "curl -X POST https://roboparts.cc/api/register -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"email\":\"you@example.com\"}'",
